// {"files":[{"path":"\\\\?\\C:\\Users\\danie\\OneDrive\\github-repos\\ai-chat-webui\\docs\\WORKSPACE.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":44,"oldLines":3,"newStart":44,"newLines":33,"lines":["   land in Phases 3–5."," - No two-user RLS proof has been run yet (user asked for no test runs);","   reviewers must run it before trusting multi-user data.","+","+## Phase 3 — Workspace shell and persistent chat","+","+Delivered:","+","+- `workspace.js`: builds the shell (sidebar with nav, pinned chats, today","+  list, user chip, sign-out; content column with topbar and view root; right","+  rail placeholder), hash router (`#/home`, `#/chat`, `#/chat/:id`,","+  `#/projects`, `#/tasks`, `#/memory`, `#/models`, `#/settings`), and","+  sidebar refresh from real Supabase data. Non-chat views show honest","+  placeholders naming their phase.","+- `app.js` is now a tiny classic entry point (the existing","+  `<script src=\"app.js\">` tag still works); all logic moved to","+  `bootstrap.js`, which persists conversations/messages via `data.js`,","+  restores them on reload and deep link, adds a working Send button, a chat","+  toolbar (new/pin/rename/delete), and resets chat state on account change.","+- `data.js`: the single data-access layer (profiles, settings,","+  conversations, messages, projects, tasks, memories + task selectors).","+- `utils.js`: shared escaping, truncation, date helpers, toasts.","+- `styles.css`: auth, shell, sidebar, rail, view, and toast styles, loaded","+  dynamically so `index.html` stays byte-identical for now.","+- `auth.js`: session gate now toggles the shell and notifies the workspace.","+- Chat sends the stored history (last 20 messages, unmodified) plus the","+  user's configured default model; prompt content is never policed or","+  rewritten by the app.","+","+Still open after Phase 3:","+","+- Home, Projects, Tasks, Memory, Models, and Settings views are placeholders.","+- Rail is hidden until Phase 5. Theme syncs to the server in Phase 6."]}]}]}
